('601b2126-3957-509c-aa8d-2e0f197e332d','a03cb945-a481-5325-9492-a0148ee19406',1,'adjective','A1','S2','W2','( comparative flatter , superlative flattest )','[{"phrase":"be flat on your back","register":null,"definition_en":"to be lying on your back – used to emphasize that someone seems unlikely to get up soon","translation":"به پشت دراز کشیدن - برای تأکید بر این نکته استفاده می شود که بعید به نظر می رسد کسی به زودی بلند شود","example":"He was drunk and flat on his back on the street.","example_translation":"او مست بود و پشتش در خیابان صاف شده بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782066.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
