('d5946225-914a-51a5-a664-ca2b922f3411','62d3e4bb-b916-5e10-aa58-995005e31e06',4,'romantic meeting','ملاقات عاشقانه','spoken & written','an occasion when you go out with someone that you like in a romantic way',null,'blind date','موقعیتی که با کسی که دوستش دارید به شکلی عاشقانه بیرون می روید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the exact/precise date I can’t remember the exact date we moved into this house.','the agreed date British English , agreed upon date American English (= one that people have agreed on ) The work was not finished by the agreed date.','the closing date (= the last day you can officially do something ) The closing date for applications is April 30th.','the due date (= the date by which something is due to happen ) Payment must be made by the due date.','the delivery date (= a date on which goods will be delivered ) The delivery date should be around 23rd August.','the publication date (= the date when something is published ) We are aiming at a publication date of mid-November.','the departure date (= the date when someone leaves ) My departure date was only a few days away.','the expiry date British English , expiration date American English (= a date on a product after which it cannot be used ) Check the expiry date on your credit card.','the sell-by date British English (= a date on a food product after which it should not be sold ) Those yoghurts are a week past their sell-by date.','decide on a date (= choose the date when something will happen ) Have you decided on a date for the wedding yet?','set/fix a date (= decide the date when something will happen ) They haven’t set a date for the election yet.','today’s date Don’t forget to put today’s date at the top of the letter.','somebody’s date of birth ( also somebody’s birth date ) (= the day and year when someone was born ) What’s your date of birth?','the date of publication/issue/departure etc formal The insurance will only cover costs incurred on or after the date of departure.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve got a date with Andrea tomorrow night.","translation":"فردا شب با آندریا قرار گذاشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001127913.mp3"},{"sentence":"I felt like a teenager going out on a first date .","translation":"احساس می کردم نوجوانی هستم که برای اولین قرار بیرون می رود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000429.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can I bring my date to the party?","translation":"آیا می توانم تاریخم را به مهمانی بیاورم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001127922.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('51429d11-e7d2-52d5-8d29-566954e7576a','62d3e4bb-b916-5e10-aa58-995005e31e06',5,'arrangement to meet somebody','ترتیب ملاقات با کسی','spoken & written','a time arranged to meet someone, especially socially',null,null,'زمانی که برای ملاقات با کسی تنظیم شده است، به خصوص از نظر اجتماعی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the exact/precise date I can’t remember the exact date we moved into this house.','the agreed date British English , agreed upon date American English (= one that people have agreed on ) The work was not finished by the agreed date.','the closing date (= the last day you can officially do something ) The closing date for applications is April 30th.','the due date (= the date by which something is due to happen ) Payment must be made by the due date.','the delivery date (= a date on which goods will be delivered ) The delivery date should be around 23rd August.','the publication date (= the date when something is published ) We are aiming at a publication date of mid-November.','the departure date (= the date when someone leaves ) My departure date was only a few days away.','the expiry date British English , expiration date American English (= a date on a product after which it cannot be used ) Check the expiry date on your credit card.','the sell-by date British English (= a date on a food product after which it should not be sold ) Those yoghurts are a week past their sell-by date.','decide on a date (= choose the date when something will happen ) Have you decided on a date for the wedding yet?','set/fix a date (= decide the date when something will happen ) They haven’t set a date for the election yet.','today’s date Don’t forget to put today’s date at the top of the letter.','somebody’s date of birth ( also somebody’s birth date ) (= the day and year when someone was born ) What’s your date of birth?','the date of publication/issue/departure etc formal The insurance will only cover costs incurred on or after the date of departure.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Let’s make a date to come over and visit.","translation":"بیایید یک قرار بگذاریم تا بیاییم و بازدید کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001700685.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c22df9ee-f6cd-54b8-9d39-060cca20d5f3','62d3e4bb-b916-5e10-aa58-995005e31e06',6,'fruit','میوه','spoken & written','a sweet sticky brown fruit with a long hard seed inside',null,null,'یک میوه قهوه ای چسبناک شیرین با یک دانه سخت دراز داخل','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the exact/precise date I can’t remember the exact date we moved into this house.','the agreed date British English , agreed upon date American English (= one that people have agreed on ) The work was not finished by the agreed date.','the closing date (= the last day you can officially do something ) The closing date for applications is April 30th.','the due date (= the date by which something is due to happen ) Payment must be made by the due date.','the delivery date (= a date on which goods will be delivered ) The delivery date should be around 23rd August.','the publication date (= the date when something is published ) We are aiming at a publication date of mid-November.','the departure date (= the date when someone leaves ) My departure date was only a few days away.','the expiry date British English , expiration date American English (= a date on a product after which it cannot be used ) Check the expiry date on your credit card.','the sell-by date British English (= a date on a food product after which it should not be sold ) Those yoghurts are a week past their sell-by date.','decide on a date (= choose the date when something will happen ) Have you decided on a date for the wedding yet?','set/fix a date (= decide the date when something will happen ) They haven’t set a date for the election yet.','today’s date Don’t forget to put today’s date at the top of the letter.','somebody’s date of birth ( also somebody’s birth date ) (= the day and year when someone was born ) What’s your date of birth?','the date of publication/issue/departure etc formal The insurance will only cover costs incurred on or after the date of departure.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('9ae87691-9d68-58b5-a647-ebdadef14fd2','950d42ee-ca1b-548f-bdb8-fb46e90fa829',1,'write date','تاریخ را بنویس','spoken & written','to write or print the date on something','[ transitive ]',null,'تاریخ زدن؛ برآمدنِ تاریخ؛ سنت داشتن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a newspaper dated November 23,1963","translation":"روزنامه ای به تاریخ 23 نوامبر 1963","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001127960.mp3"},{"sentence":"Make sure you sign and date it at the bottom.","translation":"مطمئن شوید که در پایین آن را امضا کرده و تاریخ آن را ثبت کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001700691.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('54b00f68-8819-592a-8eae-1ded886bd115','950d42ee-ca1b-548f-bdb8-fb46e90fa829',2,'find age','پیدا کردن سن','spoken & written','to find out when something old was made or formed','[ transitive ]',null,'برای اینکه بفهمیم چه زمانی چیزی قدیمی ساخته یا شکل گرفته است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The rocks are dated by examining the fossils found in the same layer.","translation":"قدمت سنگ ها با بررسی فسیل های یافت شده در همان لایه انجام می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001127965.mp3"},{"sentence":"radiocarbon dating","translation":"تاریخ گذاری رادیوکربن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001700693.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1b7feec1-d00a-580c-8b45-bdcb9931b9bc','950d42ee-ca1b-548f-bdb8-fb46e90fa829',3,'old-fashioned','از مد افتاده','spoken & written','if clothing , art etc dates, it begins to look old-fashioned','[ intransitive ]','dated','اگر لباس، هنر و غیره تاریخ داشته باشد، قدیمی به نظر می رسد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"His designs are so classic, they’ve hardly dated at all.","translation":"طرح های او آنقدر کلاسیک هستند که به ندرت به تاریخ پیوسته اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001127970.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('27fd4d64-3526-5ad6-8613-76713fcb6008','950d42ee-ca1b-548f-bdb8-fb46e90fa829',4,'relationship','رابطه','spoken & written','to have a romantic relationship with someone','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'داشتن رابطه عاشقانه با کسی',array['go out with']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Is he still dating Sarah?","translation":"آیا او هنوز با سارا قرار می گیرد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001127979.mp3"},{"sentence":"Are Chris and Liz dating?","translation":"آیا کریس و لیز با هم قرار می گذارند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040023.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0986f3fb-b492-59bb-af64-9a7f333a2b33','950d42ee-ca1b-548f-bdb8-fb46e90fa829',5,'show somebody’s age','سن کسی را نشان دهد','spoken & written','if something that you say, do, or wear dates you, it shows that you are fairly old','[ transitive ]',null,'اگر چیزی را که می‌گویید، انجام می‌دهید یا می‌پوشید، با شما تاریخ داشته باشد، نشان می‌دهد که شما نسبتاً پیر هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Yes, I remember the Moon landings – that dates me, doesn’t it?","translation":"بله، فرود روی ماه را به خاطر می آورم - این به من مربوط می شود، اینطور نیست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001127984.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d0a132c2-3405-5c16-b2ed-170310ebdc61','4f0d1c6f-0236-523e-985a-8f20cf52a90a',1,'not alive','زنده نیست','spoken & written','no longer alive',null,null,'مرده، فوت‌شده؛ بی‌روح؛ خاموش (تلفن)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['lie dead If I’m late, Mum worries that I’m lying dead somewhere.','drop dead (= die suddenly ) He dropped dead at the age of 52.','find somebody dead A man was found dead in the apartment.','shoot somebody dead He was jailed for life for shooting dead a burglar.','leave somebody dead (= result in someone dying – used especially in news reports ) The shooting left at least 28 people dead.','leave somebody for dead (= leave someone to die ) The men beat him and ran away, leaving him for dead.','pronounce somebody dead (= to say officially that someone is dead ) She was pronounced dead at the scene of the accident.','be feared dead (= used when someone is missing and people are worried that they are dead ) Hundreds of people are feared dead in a ferry disaster.','be presumed dead (= used when someone is missing and people think they are certainly dead ) The two boys have not been seen since they fell into the river, and are now presumed dead.','clinically dead (= dead based on medical checks ) A person is declared clinically dead when the brain stops working.','a dead body A dead body has been found in the woods.','long dead (= dead for a long time ) All those people I knew then are long dead now.','dead and gone informal (= completely dead ) Let’s face it, we’ll all be dead and gone soon.','more dead than alive (= very badly hurt or ill and almost dead ) He was swept up onto a beach after three days at sea, more dead than alive.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her mother had been dead for ten years.","translation":"مادرش ده سال بود که مرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001129535.mp3"},{"sentence":"Police are trying to contact the family of the dead man.","translation":"پلیس در حال تلاش برای تماس با خانواده مرد کشته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001700751.mp3"},{"sentence":"a pile of dead leaves","translation":"انبوهی از برگ های مرده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962330.mp3"},{"sentence":"the dead body of a young soldier","translation":"جسد یک سرباز جوان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001829550.mp3"},{"sentence":"Two men were shot dead by terrorists.","translation":"دو مرد به ضرب گلوله تروریست ها کشته شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001700754.mp3"},{"sentence":"Magnus was found dead in his car.","translation":"مگنوس در ماشینش جسد پیدا شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962331.mp3"},{"sentence":"One man is still missing, presumed dead .","translation":"یک مرد هنوز مفقود است که گمان می رود مرده باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962335.mp3"},{"sentence":"He suddenly had a heart attack and dropped dead .","translation":"او ناگهان دچار حمله قلبی شد و مرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001129546.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was pronounced dead on arrival at the hospital.","translation":"مرگ او در بدو ورود به بیمارستان اعلام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962339.mp3"},{"sentence":"His fellow climbers had left him for dead on the mountain.","translation":"همکوهنوردان او را برای مرده در کوه رها کرده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962343.mp3"},{"sentence":"We didn’t know if she was dead or alive.","translation":"ما نمی دانستیم که او مرده است یا زنده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962347.mp3"},{"sentence":"When they found him he was more dead than alive .","translation":"وقتی او را یافتند بیشتر مرده بود تا زنده.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962348.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her parents were long dead .","translation":"پدر و مادرش مدت ها مرده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962352.mp3"}]'::jsonb,13),
('c64b7035-d02d-5038-ae45-b5e48bf457d5','4f0d1c6f-0236-523e-985a-8f20cf52a90a',2,'not working','کار نمی کند','spoken & written','not working because there is no power','[ not before noun ]',null,'کار نمی کند زیرا برق وجود ندارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['lie dead If I’m late, Mum worries that I’m lying dead somewhere.','drop dead (= die suddenly ) He dropped dead at the age of 52.','find somebody dead A man was found dead in the apartment.','shoot somebody dead He was jailed for life for shooting dead a burglar.','leave somebody dead (= result in someone dying – used especially in news reports ) The shooting left at least 28 people dead.','leave somebody for dead (= leave someone to die ) The men beat him and ran away, leaving him for dead.','pronounce somebody dead (= to say officially that someone is dead ) She was pronounced dead at the scene of the accident.','be feared dead (= used when someone is missing and people are worried that they are dead ) Hundreds of people are feared dead in a ferry disaster.','be presumed dead (= used when someone is missing and people think they are certainly dead ) The two boys have not been seen since they fell into the river, and are now presumed dead.','clinically dead (= dead based on medical checks ) A person is declared clinically dead when the brain stops working.','a dead body A dead body has been found in the woods.','long dead (= dead for a long time ) All those people I knew then are long dead now.','dead and gone informal (= completely dead ) Let’s face it, we’ll all be dead and gone soon.','more dead than alive (= very badly hurt or ill and almost dead ) He was swept up onto a beach after three days at sea, more dead than alive.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I picked up the phone but discovered the line was dead .","translation":"تلفن را برداشتم اما متوجه شدم خط قطع شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001129571.mp3"},{"sentence":"Suddenly the radio went dead .","translation":"ناگهان رادیو خاموش شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001129574.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think the batteries are dead .","translation":"فکر کنم باتری ها تموم شده.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001987899.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
