('ee373880-73a5-567b-91d3-0edb752f0d9a','0ddaaf9c-7b16-5da5-9af7-241d8649628b',1,'say something is not true','بگو چیزی درست نیست','spoken & written','to say that something is not true, or that you do not believe something',null,null,'انکار کردن، رد کردن؛ نپذیرفتن (دسترسی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['deny a charge/allegation Officials denied allegations that torture was widespread.','deny any involvement in something The chairman denied any involvement in the affair.','deny all knowledge of something CIA officers denied all knowledge of the operation.','deny a fact You can’t deny the fact that we made a mistake.','deny a rumour Their chief executive denied rumours of the company’s decline.','deny a claim Claims that money had been wasted were denied by the chairman of the committee.','deny the existence of something The government has denied the existence of any political prisoners in the country.','deny any wrongdoing formal (= illegal or immoral behaviour ) The White House denied any wrongdoing.','strongly/firmly deny something Reports of government corruption have been strongly denied.','vehemently/vigorously/strenuously deny something (= very strongly ) He vehemently denied that he had ever been to her house.','flatly/categorically deny something (= very definitely and directly ) In the interview, he flatly denied that charge.','hotly deny something (= in an angry or excited way ) She hotly denied ever having taken drugs.','repeatedly deny something King has repeatedly denied being a gang member.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve never denied that there is a housing problem.","translation":"من هرگز انکار نکردم که مشکل مسکن وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001134587.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t deny her remarks hurt me.","translation":"نمی توانم انکار کنم که اظهارات او به من صدمه زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001134588.mp3"},{"sentence":"Two men have denied murdering a woman at a remote picnic spot.","translation":"دو مرد قتل یک زن را در یک مکان دورافتاده برای پیک نیک انکار کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001134591.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jackson vehemently denied the allegations.","translation":"جکسون به شدت این اتهامات را رد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001134595.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government denied the existence of poverty among 16- and 17-year-olds.","translation":"دولت وجود فقر را در میان نوجوانان 16 و 17 ساله انکار کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001134584.mp3"},{"sentence":"The men have denied charges of theft.","translation":"این افراد اتهام سرقت را رد کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748142.mp3"},{"sentence":"She denied taking the money.","translation":"او گرفتن پول را انکار کرد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,7),
('552e5a6f-79dd-56e9-b73c-b68a24d063e8','0ddaaf9c-7b16-5da5-9af7-241d8649628b',2,'not allow','اجازه نمی دهد','spoken & written','to refuse to allow someone to have or do something',null,null,'امتناع از اجازه دادن به کسی برای داشتن یا انجام کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['deny a charge/allegation Officials denied allegations that torture was widespread.','deny any involvement in something The chairman denied any involvement in the affair.','deny all knowledge of something CIA officers denied all knowledge of the operation.','deny a fact You can’t deny the fact that we made a mistake.','deny a rumour Their chief executive denied rumours of the company’s decline.','deny a claim Claims that money had been wasted were denied by the chairman of the committee.','deny the existence of something The government has denied the existence of any political prisoners in the country.','deny any wrongdoing formal (= illegal or immoral behaviour ) The White House denied any wrongdoing.','strongly/firmly deny something Reports of government corruption have been strongly denied.','vehemently/vigorously/strenuously deny something (= very strongly ) He vehemently denied that he had ever been to her house.','flatly/categorically deny something (= very definitely and directly ) In the interview, he flatly denied that charge.','hotly deny something (= in an angry or excited way ) She hotly denied ever having taken drugs.','repeatedly deny something King has repeatedly denied being a gang member.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Some landowners deny access to the countryside.","translation":"برخی از مالکان از دسترسی به حومه شهر خودداری می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00272.mp3"},{"sentence":"She could deny her son nothing.","translation":"او نمی توانست هیچ چیز را به پسرش انکار کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001134605.mp3"},{"sentence":"This is the only country in Europe to deny cancer screening to its citizens.","translation":"این تنها کشور در اروپاست که غربالگری سرطان را برای شهروندان خود رد کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001134608.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('9b0cc2a0-6eeb-5b5a-a6c0-5409e74d7b16','0ddaaf9c-7b16-5da5-9af7-241d8649628b',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'there’s no denying (that/something)','انکار کردن، رد کردن؛ نپذیرفتن (دسترسی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['deny a charge/allegation Officials denied allegations that torture was widespread.','deny any involvement in something The chairman denied any involvement in the affair.','deny all knowledge of something CIA officers denied all knowledge of the operation.','deny a fact You can’t deny the fact that we made a mistake.','deny a rumour Their chief executive denied rumours of the company’s decline.','deny a claim Claims that money had been wasted were denied by the chairman of the committee.','deny the existence of something The government has denied the existence of any political prisoners in the country.','deny any wrongdoing formal (= illegal or immoral behaviour ) The White House denied any wrongdoing.','strongly/firmly deny something Reports of government corruption have been strongly denied.','vehemently/vigorously/strenuously deny something (= very strongly ) He vehemently denied that he had ever been to her house.','flatly/categorically deny something (= very definitely and directly ) In the interview, he flatly denied that charge.','hotly deny something (= in an angry or excited way ) She hotly denied ever having taken drugs.','repeatedly deny something King has repeatedly denied being a gang member.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f6214dd7-a590-5ceb-9878-b77414d62e7b','0ddaaf9c-7b16-5da5-9af7-241d8649628b',4,'feelings','احساسات','spoken & written','to refuse to admit that you are feeling something',null,null,'امتناع از اعتراف به اینکه چیزی را احساس می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['deny a charge/allegation Officials denied allegations that torture was widespread.','deny any involvement in something The chairman denied any involvement in the affair.','deny all knowledge of something CIA officers denied all knowledge of the operation.','deny a fact You can’t deny the fact that we made a mistake.','deny a rumour Their chief executive denied rumours of the company’s decline.','deny a claim Claims that money had been wasted were denied by the chairman of the committee.','deny the existence of something The government has denied the existence of any political prisoners in the country.','deny any wrongdoing formal (= illegal or immoral behaviour ) The White House denied any wrongdoing.','strongly/firmly deny something Reports of government corruption have been strongly denied.','vehemently/vigorously/strenuously deny something (= very strongly ) He vehemently denied that he had ever been to her house.','flatly/categorically deny something (= very definitely and directly ) In the interview, he flatly denied that charge.','hotly deny something (= in an angry or excited way ) She hotly denied ever having taken drugs.','repeatedly deny something King has repeatedly denied being a gang member.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Emotions can become destructive if they are suppressed and denied.","translation":"احساسات در صورت سرکوب و انکار می توانند مخرب شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001134632.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cd0f052b-fab8-5a37-b475-dae2f063805d','0ddaaf9c-7b16-5da5-9af7-241d8649628b',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'deny yourself (something)','انکار کردن، رد کردن؛ نپذیرفتن (دسترسی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['deny a charge/allegation Officials denied allegations that torture was widespread.','deny any involvement in something The chairman denied any involvement in the affair.','deny all knowledge of something CIA officers denied all knowledge of the operation.','deny a fact You can’t deny the fact that we made a mistake.','deny a rumour Their chief executive denied rumours of the company’s decline.','deny a claim Claims that money had been wasted were denied by the chairman of the committee.','deny the existence of something The government has denied the existence of any political prisoners in the country.','deny any wrongdoing formal (= illegal or immoral behaviour ) The White House denied any wrongdoing.','strongly/firmly deny something Reports of government corruption have been strongly denied.','vehemently/vigorously/strenuously deny something (= very strongly ) He vehemently denied that he had ever been to her house.','flatly/categorically deny something (= very definitely and directly ) In the interview, he flatly denied that charge.','hotly deny something (= in an angry or excited way ) She hotly denied ever having taken drugs.','repeatedly deny something King has repeatedly denied being a gang member.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('269d51e1-de38-5ac5-bad3-f653d72c0658','06dc0242-4382-5a3e-8852-084385078bff',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of furniture like a table , usually with drawers in it, that you sit at to write and work',null,null,'میز کار، تحریر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['tidy How come your desk is always so tidy?','cluttered (= covered with papers, books etc in an untidy way ) His desk is so cluttered he can''t find anything.','empty (= that no one is using ) There are one or two empty desks in the office.','a school desk The children are at their school desks by 8:30 in the morning.','an office desk I got back from holiday to find piles of papers on my office desk.','a writing desk (= that you use for writing letters etc ) Under the window was a small writing desk.','a wooden/mahogany/rosewood etc desk He sat at a plain wooden desk.','sit at a desk I don''t want to do a job in which I''m sitting at a desk all day.','get up from your desk He got up from his desk to welcome the visitors.','tidy your desk I need to tidy my desk.','clear your desk (= remove all the papers etc from it ) It''s a good idea to clear your desk regularly.','a desk job (= working mostly at a desk in an office ) He left his desk job to become a gardener.','a desk drawer I think I left my car keys in the desk drawer.','a desk lamp Don''t forget to switch off the desk lamp.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Marie was sitting at her desk.","translation":"ماری پشت میزش نشسته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716094.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('286642e6-26a0-5e2b-8fc6-23ccb8933d91','06dc0242-4382-5a3e-8852-084385078bff',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a place where you can get information or use a particular service in a hotel , airport etc',null,null,'مکانی که در آن می توانید اطلاعات کسب کنید یا از خدمات خاصی در هتل، فرودگاه و غیره استفاده کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['tidy How come your desk is always so tidy?','cluttered (= covered with papers, books etc in an untidy way ) His desk is so cluttered he can''t find anything.','empty (= that no one is using ) There are one or two empty desks in the office.','a school desk The children are at their school desks by 8:30 in the morning.','an office desk I got back from holiday to find piles of papers on my office desk.','a writing desk (= that you use for writing letters etc ) Under the window was a small writing desk.','a wooden/mahogany/rosewood etc desk He sat at a plain wooden desk.','sit at a desk I don''t want to do a job in which I''m sitting at a desk all day.','get up from your desk He got up from his desk to welcome the visitors.','tidy your desk I need to tidy my desk.','clear your desk (= remove all the papers etc from it ) It''s a good idea to clear your desk regularly.','a desk job (= working mostly at a desk in an office ) He left his desk job to become a gardener.','a desk drawer I think I left my car keys in the desk drawer.','a desk lamp Don''t forget to switch off the desk lamp.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the reception desk","translation":"میز پذیرش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716095.mp3"},{"sentence":"the check-in desk","translation":"میز ورود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000819745.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3f29c494-e406-5e53-bbdc-db3612733f6f','06dc0242-4382-5a3e-8852-084385078bff',3,null,null,'spoken & written','an office that deals with a particular subject , especially in newspapers or television',null,null,'دفتری که به موضوع خاصی می پردازد، به ویژه در روزنامه ها یا تلویزیون','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['tidy How come your desk is always so tidy?','cluttered (= covered with papers, books etc in an untidy way ) His desk is so cluttered he can''t find anything.','empty (= that no one is using ) There are one or two empty desks in the office.','a school desk The children are at their school desks by 8:30 in the morning.','an office desk I got back from holiday to find piles of papers on my office desk.','a writing desk (= that you use for writing letters etc ) Under the window was a small writing desk.','a wooden/mahogany/rosewood etc desk He sat at a plain wooden desk.','sit at a desk I don''t want to do a job in which I''m sitting at a desk all day.','get up from your desk He got up from his desk to welcome the visitors.','tidy your desk I need to tidy my desk.','clear your desk (= remove all the papers etc from it ) It''s a good idea to clear your desk regularly.','a desk job (= working mostly at a desk in an office ) He left his desk job to become a gardener.','a desk drawer I think I left my car keys in the desk drawer.','a desk lamp Don''t forget to switch off the desk lamp.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3117d53d-0354-55d3-b80b-53c4a58e4bc7','d70ec140-80f9-5eb5-a92d-289c1150ee63',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a way of eating in which you only eat certain foods, in order to lose weight , or to improve your health','[ countable ]',null,'رژیم غذایی؛ رژیم لاغری؛ سیره غذایی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be on a diet (= to only eat certain foods in order to lose weight ) No cake, thanks – I’m on a diet.','go on a diet (= start eating less or only some types of food ) I really ought to go on a diet.','follow a diet (= only eat certain types of food ) You will feel better if you follow a low-fat diet.','stick to a diet (= continue to follow a diet ) Most people find it hard to stick to a diet.','a strict diet (= in which you eat a very limited amount or range of food ) She followed a strict diet for several weeks.','a crash diet (= a very sudden and strict attempt to lose weight ) It’s better to lose weight gradually than to go on a crash diet.','a low-calorie/low-fat etc diet A low-calorie diet should solve your weight problem.','a starvation diet (= in which you eat very little ) A starvation diet can have negative health effects.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Lyn always seems to be on a diet.","translation":"به نظر می رسد لین همیشه رژیم دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001142853.mp3"},{"sentence":"a salt-free diet","translation":"یک رژیم غذایی بدون نمک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001277794.mp3"},{"sentence":"Not all diets are good for you.","translation":"همه رژیم ها برای شما خوب نیستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000457.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('80adddd8-95f0-50eb-ab29-c66b80eeb0bb','d70ec140-80f9-5eb5-a92d-289c1150ee63',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the kind of food that a person or animal eats each day','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'نوع غذایی که یک شخص یا حیوان هر روز می خورد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She doesn’t eat a very healthy diet .","translation":"او یک رژیم غذایی خیلی سالم نمی‌خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040026.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is important to have a balanced diet .","translation":"مهم است که یک رژیم غذایی متعادل داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040027.mp3"},{"sentence":"the effects of poor diet and lack of exercise","translation":"اثرات رژیم غذایی نامناسب و ورزش نکردن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001690002.mp3"},{"sentence":"Rice is the staple diet (= the main food that a group of people usually eat ) .","translation":"برنج رژيم غذايي اصلي است (= غذاي اصلي كه معمولاً گروهي از مردم مي خورند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040028.mp3"},{"sentence":"Studies have shown the benefits of a vegetarian diet .","translation":"مطالعات فواید رژیم گیاهخواری را نشان داده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040029.mp3"},{"sentence":"They exist on a diet of fish.","translation":"آنها در رژیم غذایی ماهی وجود دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001142844.mp3"},{"sentence":"the importance of vitamins and minerals in your diet","translation":"اهمیت ویتامین ها و مواد معدنی در رژیم غذایی شما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001690008.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('75bfcbfb-15ed-5521-9931-68542003afd9','d70ec140-80f9-5eb5-a92d-289c1150ee63',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'a diet of something','رژیم غذایی؛ رژیم لاغری؛ سیره غذایی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
