your foot (= the rounded part of your foot at the base of the toes ) He has a blister on the ball of his foot.','the heel of your foot (= the curved back part of your foot ) He kicked his opponent with the heel of his foot.','at somebody’s feet (= on the ground, near your feet ) The dog was sitting at his master’s feet.','in your stockinged/stocking feet (= not wearing shoes ) She stood 5ft 6 inches tall in her stockinged feet.','my feet are killing me informal (= my feet are hurting )']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s six feet tall , with blonde hair.","translation":"او شش فوت قد دارد، با موهای بلوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001267194.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mark was standing just a few feet away from me.","translation":"مارک در چند قدمی من ایستاده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001717866.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d say she’s about five foot three (= five feet and three inches ) .","translation":"من می توانم بگویم که او حدود پنج فوت سه (= پنج فوت و سه اینچ) است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001809432.mp3"},{"sentence":"a four-foot wall","translation":"یک دیوار چهار فوتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00347.mp3"},{"sentence":"15,000 square feet of office space","translation":"15000 فوت مربع فضای اداری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001717869.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
