('8af4d48d-070e-5df5-8f4f-885871c8f57c','6bd6ced1-0334-5f20-8fc7-970cc7c701ed',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of young people who spend time together, and who are often involved in crime or drugs and who often fight against other groups',null,null,'گروه خلافکار، اوباش؛ دسته (کارگران)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a criminal gang He had links with drug smuggling and criminal gangs.','an armed gang (= with guns ) An armed gang stole jewels worth more than five million pounds.','a rival gang Fighting between rival gangs left dozens of people injured.','a street gang (= which spends a lot of time on the streets ) He belonged to a notorious street gang which terrorized a Chicago suburb.','a teenage/youth gang At age nine, Pedro joined one of the youth gangs in his neighborhood, just to survive.','a gang member/a member of a gang Gang members are thought to be responsible for up to 20% of murders in the city.','a gang leader Gang leaders used cellphones to order the attacks.','gang violence Residents say that gang violence is common.','gang warfare (= fighting between gangs ) Gang warfare is wrecking the neighborhood.','gang crime (= crime committed by gangs ) The initiative aims to cut gang crime in Los Angeles.','gang activity In most areas, gun crime is linked to gang activity.','join a gang He was only eight when he joined the gang.','belong to a gang Eleven men belonging to a local gang were arrested.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"two rival street gangs","translation":"دو باند خیابانی رقیب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001697948.mp3"},{"sentence":"The parents have denied that their son is a gang member.","translation":"والدین عضویت پسرشان را رد کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782876.mp3"},{"sentence":"the problem of inner-city gang violence","translation":"مشکل خشونت باندهای درون شهری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782877.mp3"},{"sentence":"a victim of gang warfare","translation":"قربانی جنگ باند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782878.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were always gangs of kids hanging around the mall.","translation":"همیشه گروه هایی از بچه ها در اطراف مرکز خرید آویزان بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001320583.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('8e0d27aa-7371-5894-8c09-d920f35f6dcc','6bd6ced1-0334-5f20-8fc7-970cc7c701ed',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of criminals who work together',null,null,'گروهی از جنایتکاران که با هم کار می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a criminal gang He had links with drug smuggling and criminal gangs.','an armed gang (= with guns ) An armed gang stole jewels worth more than five million pounds.','a rival gang Fighting between rival gangs left dozens of people injured.','a street gang (= which spends a lot of time on the streets ) He belonged to a notorious street gang which terrorized a Chicago suburb.','a teenage/youth gang At age nine, Pedro joined one of the youth gangs in his neighborhood, just to survive.','a gang member/a member of a gang Gang members are thought to be responsible for up to 20% of murders in the city.','a gang leader Gang leaders used cellphones to order the attacks.','gang violence Residents say that gang violence is common.','gang warfare (= fighting between gangs ) Gang warfare is wrecking the neighborhood.','gang crime (= crime committed by gangs ) The initiative aims to cut gang crime in Los Angeles.','gang activity In most areas, gun crime is linked to gang activity.','join a gang He was only eight when he joined the gang.','belong to a gang Eleven men belonging to a local gang were arrested.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Several gangs were operating in the area.","translation":"چندین باند در منطقه فعالیت می کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001320588.mp3"},{"sentence":"Armed gangs have hijacked lorries.","translation":"باندهای مسلح کامیون ها را ربوده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001697960.mp3"},{"sentence":"a gang of smugglers","translation":"یک باند قاچاقچی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001320591.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
