('7641b2b0-3692-53e2-bd8d-1372a48776ce','f5300f4d-691b-5176-8442-d694becfc5bf',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if people gang together , they form a group in order to do something together, especially to oppose something',null,'gang together','اگر مردم با هم گروه شوند، گروهی را تشکیل می دهند تا با هم کاری انجام دهند، به ویژه برای مخالفت با چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The smaller shopkeepers ganged together to beat off competition from the supermarkets.","translation":"مغازه داران کوچکتر با هم گروه شدند تا رقابت سوپرمارکت ها را شکست دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001697968.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e193228a-1c8c-561a-81a3-967080c61a76','e9ae3a89-3486-57dc-9135-1886e8210095',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the part of a fence or outside wall that you can open and close so that you can enter or leave a place','[ countable ]',null,'دروازه، در؛ دروازه (درب)؛ گیت (فرودگاه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['open a gate He heard Jack open the gate.','close/shut a gate Please close the gate.','lock/padlock a gate (= close it with a key/a special lock ) She locked the gate behind her.','go through a gate They went through the gate into the orchard.','leave the gate open Someone left the gate open, and the dog got out.','the front/back gate (= the gate in front of or at the back of a building ) She stood outside the front gate of the cottage.','the entrance gate Derek met us at the entrance gate.','the main gate (= where most people go in ) Soldiers were guarding the main gate.','a garden gate Ellie ran down the path towards the garden gate.','a farm/factory/school etc gate I carefully shut the farm gate behind me. Lots of parents were waiting outside the school gate.','a wooden/iron/wrought-iron gate Their way was barred by huge wrought-iron gates.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We went through the gate into the orchard.","translation":"از دروازه وارد باغ شدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710908.mp3"},{"sentence":"the wrought-iron gates of the palace","translation":"دروازه های فرفورژه کاخ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001284697.mp3"},{"sentence":"I left the engine running and ran back to close the gate.","translation":"موتور را روشن گذاشتم و برگشتم تا در را ببندم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001832633.mp3"},{"sentence":"Make sure that the back gate is locked, please.","translation":"لطفا مطمئن شوید که درب عقب قفل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710907.mp3"},{"sentence":"The children poured out of the school gates.","translation":"بچه ها از دروازه مدرسه بیرون ریختند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001832636.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('a3079c50-0ab9-5e4a-8ddf-c1f08fd73ffd','e9ae3a89-3486-57dc-9135-1886e8210095',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the place where you leave an airport building to get on a plane','[ countable ]',null,'جایی که ساختمان فرودگاه را برای سوار شدن به هواپیما ترک می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['open a gate He heard Jack open the gate.','close/shut a gate Please close the gate.','lock/padlock a gate (= close it with a key/a special lock ) She locked the gate behind her.','go through a gate They went through the gate into the orchard.','leave the gate open Someone left the gate open, and the dog got out.','the front/back gate (= the gate in front of or at the back of a building ) She stood outside the front gate of the cottage.','the entrance gate Derek met us at the entrance gate.','the main gate (= where most people go in ) Soldiers were guarding the main gate.','a garden gate Ellie ran down the path towards the garden gate.','a farm/factory/school etc gate I carefully shut the farm gate behind me. Lots of parents were waiting outside the school gate.','a wooden/iron/wrought-iron gate Their way was barred by huge wrought-iron gates.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Air France flight 76 leaves from gate 6A.","translation":"پرواز 76 ایرفرانس از دروازه 6A حرکت می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001284708.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f33f75e4-f149-5bf2-a97b-3c4c2942a6f5','e9ae3a89-3486-57dc-9135-1886e8210095',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the number of people who go in to see a sports event , especially a football match','[ countable ]',null,'تعداد افرادی که برای دیدن یک رویداد ورزشی به خصوص یک مسابقه فوتبال وارد می شوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['open a gate He heard Jack open the gate.','close/shut a gate Please close the gate.','lock/padlock a gate (= close it with a key/a special lock ) She locked the gate behind her.','go through a gate They went through the gate into the orchard.','leave the gate open Someone left the gate open, and the dog got out.','the front/back gate (= the gate in front of or at the back of a building ) She stood outside the front gate of the cottage.','the entrance gate Derek met us at the entrance gate.','the main gate (= where most people go in ) Soldiers were guarding the main gate.','a garden gate Ellie ran down the path towards the garden gate.','a farm/factory/school etc gate I carefully shut the farm gate behind me. Lots of parents were waiting outside the school gate.','a wooden/iron/wrought-iron gate Their way was barred by huge wrought-iron gates.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b5fbe308-e333-5052-aa11-246785fa214b','a5773421-af96-5afb-9221-040a44049401',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to prevent a student from leaving a school as a punishment for behaving badly',null,null,'جلوگیری از خروج دانش آموز از مدرسه به عنوان تنبیه رفتار بد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('72a9fa89-3acb-5e82-9fd0-b2beef2e57b3','450ea303-8439-504d-8d87-33b7dea64783',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used after the name of a place, person, or thing to give a name to an event involving dishonest behaviour by a politician or other public official',null,null,'بعد از نام مکان، شخص یا چیزی برای نامگذاری رویدادی که شامل رفتار غیرصادقانه یک سیاستمدار یا سایر مقامات دولتی است استفاده می شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Irangate (= when members of the US government sold weapons to Iran in exchange for the return of American hostages )","translation":"ایران گیت (= زمانی که اعضای دولت آمریکا در ازای بازگرداندن گروگان های آمریکایی به ایران اسلحه فروختند)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001832638.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('00a86dc9-ba31-53c4-a5b0-119a9e90da32','b87d6222-af34-5007-9963-c06c8c3972d9',1,'in cars etc','در اتومبیل و غیره','spoken & written','the machinery in a vehicle such as a car, truck , or bicycle that you use to go comfortably at different speeds','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'دنده (خودرو)؛ چرخ‌دنده؛ تجهیزات (ورزشی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['first/second/third etc gear The heavy traffic meant that we seldom got out of second gear.','a low gear (= first or second gear ) You should use a low gear when going up a hill.','a high gear (= third, fourth, or fifth gear ) Put the car into a higher gear.','top gear British English (= the highest gear ) Hamilton slipped effortlessly into top gear.','bottom gear British English (= the lowest gear ) The car trundled slowly forward in bottom gear.','reverse gear (= for driving backwards ) He put the truck into reverse gear.','change gear ( also switch/shift gears American English ) It takes some time to learn when to change gear.','put the car etc into (first/second/third etc) gear He put the car into gear, and they moved slowly forwards.','engage first/second etc gear (= put the car into gear ) Nick struggled to engage first gear.','be in the wrong gear The straining noises from the engine told him that he was in the wrong gear.','crunch/grind the gears (= change gear in a way that makes an unpleasant noise ) He crunched the gears into reverse.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"His mountain bike had 18 gears.","translation":"دوچرخه کوهستان او 18 دنده داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001968967.mp3"},{"sentence":"Andy drove cautiously along in third gear .","translation":"اندی با احتیاط با دنده سوم رانندگی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001968968.mp3"},{"sentence":"Does this thing have a reverse gear ?","translation":"آیا این وسیله دنده عقب دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001968972.mp3"},{"sentence":"Any cyclist can climb a difficult hill; you just change gear .","translation":"هر دوچرخه سواری می تواند از یک تپه دشوار بالا برود. شما فقط دنده را عوض کنید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001968976.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t turn off the engine while you’re still in gear .","translation":"در حالی که هنوز در دنده هستید موتور را خاموش نکنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001968980.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s a good habit to take the car out of gear while you’re at a stoplight.","translation":"این عادت خوبی است که ماشین را از دنده خارج کنید در حالی که در چراغ توقف هستید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001968984.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('abf6198a-6a3b-5c12-853f-e61bf1759bc5','b87d6222-af34-5007-9963-c06c8c3972d9',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to talk about the amount of effort and energy that someone is using in a situation','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'برای صحبت در مورد میزان تلاش و انرژی که کسی در یک موقعیت استفاده می کند استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['first/second/third etc gear The heavy traffic meant that we seldom got out of second gear.','a low gear (= first or second gear ) You should use a low gear when going up a hill.','a high gear (= third, fourth, or fifth gear ) Put the car into a higher gear.','top gear British English (= the highest gear ) Hamilton slipped effortlessly into top gear.','bottom gear British English (= the lowest gear ) The car trundled slowly forward in bottom gear.','reverse gear (= for driving backwards ) He put the truck into reverse gear.','change gear ( also switch/shift gears American English ) It takes some time to learn when to change gear.','put the car etc into (first/second/third etc) gear He put the car into gear, and they moved slowly forwards.','engage first/second etc gear (= put the car into gear ) Nick struggled to engage first gear.','be in the wrong gear The straining noises from the engine told him that he was in the wrong gear.','crunch/grind the gears (= change gear in a way that makes an unpleasant noise ) He crunched the gears into reverse.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"During this period, Japan’s export industries were in top gear (= were as active as they could be ) .","translation":"در این دوره، صنایع صادراتی ژاپن در بهترین حالت بودند (= تا جایی که می‌توانستند فعال بودند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001286322.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Republican’s propaganda machine moved into high gear .","translation":"ماشین تبلیغاتی جمهوری خواهان به سرعت بالا رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001286323.mp3"},{"sentence":"United stepped up a gear in the second half.","translation":"یونایتد در نیمه دوم سرعت خود را افزایش داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001711000.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a192494d-6210-50d8-823d-d89c53bedb9a','b87d6222-af34-5007-9963-c06c8c3972d9',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'change gear','دنده (خودرو)؛ چرخ‌دنده؛ تجهیزات (ورزشی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['first/second/third etc gear The heavy traffic meant that we seldom got out of second gear.','a low gear (= first or second gear ) You should use a low gear when going up a hill.','a high gear (= third, fourth, or fifth gear ) Put the car into a higher gear.','top gear British English (= the highest gear ) Hamilton slipped effortlessly into top gear.','bottom gear British English (= the lowest gear ) The car trundled slowly forward in bottom gear.','reverse gear (= for driving backwards ) He put the truck into reverse gear.','change gear ( also switch/shift gears American English ) It takes some time to learn when to change gear.','put the car etc into (first/second/third etc) gear He put the car into gear, and they moved slowly forwards.','engage first/second etc gear (= put the car into gear ) Nick struggled to engage first gear.','be in the wrong gear The straining noises from the engine told him that he was in the wrong gear.','crunch/grind the gears (= change gear in a way that makes an unpleasant noise ) He crunched the gears into reverse.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('deee5d0c-984f-5978-a692-7adcc62d9220','b87d6222-af34-5007-9963-c06c8c3972d9',4,'equipment','تجهیزات','spoken & written','a set of equipment or tools you need for a particular activity','[ uncountable ]',null,'مجموعه ای از تجهیزات یا ابزارهایی که برای یک فعالیت خاص نیاز دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['first/second/third etc gear The heavy traffic meant that we seldom got out of second gear.','a low gear (= first or second gear ) You should use a low gear when going up a hill.','a high gear (= third, fourth, or fifth gear ) Put the car into a higher gear.','top gear British English (= the highest gear ) Hamilton slipped effortlessly into top gear.','bottom gear British English (= the lowest gear ) The car trundled slowly forward in bottom gear.','reverse gear (= for driving backwards ) He put the truck into reverse gear.','change gear ( also switch/shift gears American English ) It takes some time to learn when to change gear.','put the car etc into (first/second/third etc) gear He put the car into gear, and they moved slowly forwards.','engage first/second etc gear (= put the car into gear ) Nick struggled to engage first gear.','be in the wrong gear The straining noises from the engine told him that he was in the wrong gear.','crunch/grind the gears (= change gear in a way that makes an unpleasant noise ) He crunched the gears into reverse.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s crazy about photography – he’s got all the gear.","translation":"او دیوانه عکاسی است - او همه وسایل را در اختیار دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001286289.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ll need some camping gear.","translation":"به وسایل کمپینگ نیاز داریم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001286290.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
