('1615e469-98be-5d9e-ac68-d3c88cbb30b4','b87d6222-af34-5007-9963-c06c8c3972d9',7,'drugs','مواد مخدر','informal','a word meaning illegal drugs , used by people who take drugs','[ uncountable ]',null,'کلمه ای به معنای مواد مخدر غیرقانونی که توسط افرادی که مواد مصرف می کنند استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['first/second/third etc gear The heavy traffic meant that we seldom got out of second gear.','a low gear (= first or second gear ) You should use a low gear when going up a hill.','a high gear (= third, fourth, or fifth gear ) Put the car into a higher gear.','top gear British English (= the highest gear ) Hamilton slipped effortlessly into top gear.','bottom gear British English (= the lowest gear ) The car trundled slowly forward in bottom gear.','reverse gear (= for driving backwards ) He put the truck into reverse gear.','change gear ( also switch/shift gears American English ) It takes some time to learn when to change gear.','put the car etc into (first/second/third etc) gear He put the car into gear, and they moved slowly forwards.','engage first/second etc gear (= put the car into gear ) Nick struggled to engage first gear.','be in the wrong gear The straining noises from the engine told him that he was in the wrong gear.','crunch/grind the gears (= change gear in a way that makes an unpleasant noise ) He crunched the gears into reverse.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('14cb300b-d567-522a-8011-ea36c1e36540','b87d6222-af34-5007-9963-c06c8c3972d9',8,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'get your ass in gear','دنده (خودرو)؛ چرخ‌دنده؛ تجهیزات (ورزشی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['first/second/third etc gear The heavy traffic meant that we seldom got out of second gear.','a low gear (= first or second gear ) You should use a low gear when going up a hill.','a high gear (= third, fourth, or fifth gear ) Put the car into a higher gear.','top gear British English (= the highest gear ) Hamilton slipped effortlessly into top gear.','bottom gear British English (= the lowest gear ) The car trundled slowly forward in bottom gear.','reverse gear (= for driving backwards ) He put the truck into reverse gear.','change gear ( also switch/shift gears American English ) It takes some time to learn when to change gear.','put the car etc into (first/second/third etc) gear He put the car into gear, and they moved slowly forwards.','engage first/second etc gear (= put the car into gear ) Nick struggled to engage first gear.','be in the wrong gear The straining noises from the engine told him that he was in the wrong gear.','crunch/grind the gears (= change gear in a way that makes an unpleasant noise ) He crunched the gears into reverse.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('66cec094-eeb0-566d-a1b3-4e02bce809d2','09f1eb5a-7eef-5c8b-9ba4-fab3087e0ebb',1,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be geared to somebody/something',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('284ef332-59d5-598e-ba59-7d083fd946e8','18cb537f-22a7-505b-8c1d-7565a27db64c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a part of a cell in a living thing that controls what it looks like, how it grows, and how it develops . People get their genes from their parents .',null,null,'ژن، وراثت (زیست‌شناسی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a dominant gene (= a gene that has its effect when there is only one copy of it ) The disease occurs when a child inherits a single dominant gene from a parent with the disease.','a recessive gene (= a gene that has its effect only when there are two copies of it ) The gene for blue eyes is recessive.','a defective/faulty gene (= a gene that does not work properly ) The disease is caused by a defective gene.','a human gene The actual number of human genes is still in dispute.','have a gene Identical twins have the same genes.','carry a gene (= have a gene that causes a medical condition which you can pass on to your children ) Some women carry a gene which makes them more likely to develop breast cancer.','pass on a gene (= pass a gene to your children ) All animals try to maximize their chances of passing on their genes to the next generation.','inherit a gene (= get a gene from your parents ) Children who inherit the defective gene seem normal at birth apart from a deformity of the toe.','identify/discover a gene (= find a particular gene which is responsible for something ) Scientists have identified a gene which seems to protect Chinese people from some types of cancer.','the gene pool (= all the genes in a particular species ) It is hoped that these new wolves will mate with the native population and increase the wolves'' gene pool.','gene therapy (= using genes to treat diseases ) Scientists have successfully treated the disease using gene therapy.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"human genes","translation":"ژن های انسانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001726009.mp3"},{"sentence":"the genes that regulate cell division","translation":"ژن هایی که تقسیم سلولی را تنظیم می کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001726010.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3eed4310-4257-5092-80b2-f4b1afd4ea9b','a2d9cdfa-840d-5659-b566-0fd638c26fa5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you give someone, for example to thank them or because you like them, especially on a special occasion',null,null,'هدیه، پیشکش؛ استعداد (ذاتی)',array['present']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give somebody a gift We gave her a gift on her birthday.','receive a gift He received a gift from his aunt.','accept a gift Sam accepted the gift on behalf of the school.','make somebody a gift of something formal (= give someone something as a gift ) Johnson made her a gift of a book.','wrap (up) a gift She had bought and wrapped gifts for children in hospital.','shower somebody with gifts (= give someone a lot of gifts ) He showered her with gifts and exotic holidays.','exchange gifts (= give someone a gift at the same time as they give you a gift ) We exchange gifts on Christmas Day.','a birthday gift The camera had been a 21st birthday gift from his parents.','a wedding gift Some people prefer to give cash as a wedding gift.','a Christmas gift Before 1940, most people did not wrap Christmas gifts.','a free gift (= something that a shop or business gives you ) If you spend over £50, you get a free gift.','the perfect/ideal gift for somebody This book is the perfect gift for anybody who’s interested in birds.','a suitable gift What do you think would be a suitable gift for a 10-year-old boy?','a small gift Here’s a small gift to show our appreciation for all your hard work.','a generous gift Her colleagues presented her with a generous gift when she retired.','an expensive gift He was always showering Louise with expensive gifts.','a lavish gift (= a large, impressive, or expensive gift ) She received lavish gifts of jewellery and clothes.','a parting gift (= a gift that you give someone when you leave/say goodbye ) She brought him a parting gift.','an unwanted gift You can take any unwanted gifts to charity shops.','a gift idea Here is another gift idea with children in mind.','a gift shop The gift shop was well stocked with souvenirs.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The earrings were a gift from my aunt.","translation":"گوشواره ها هدیه عمه ام بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969079.mp3"},{"sentence":"a generous gift of £50","translation":"یک هدیه سخاوتمندانه 50 پوندی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969082.mp3"},{"sentence":"The clock was given as a retirement gift when he left the police.","translation":"این ساعت به عنوان هدیه بازنشستگی در زمان ترک پلیس به او داده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969083.mp3"},{"sentence":"expensive wedding gifts","translation":"هدایای عروسی گران قیمت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969089.mp3"},{"sentence":"Enjoy a free gift with any purchase of $20 or more.","translation":"با خرید 20 دلاری یا بیشتر از یک هدیه رایگان لذت ببرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969092.mp3"},{"sentence":"This excellent cookbook would make an ideal gift for anyone just going away to college.","translation":"این کتاب آشپزی عالی برای هر کسی که تازه وارد دانشگاه می شود یک هدیه ایده آل خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969096.mp3"},{"sentence":"These were a present from my boyfriend.","translation":"اینها هدیه دوست پسرم بود.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,7),
('16bf8047-8fb7-5bf9-9e6c-a4f4b3ca27c0','a2d9cdfa-840d-5659-b566-0fd638c26fa5',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a natural ability',null,'gifted','یک توانایی طبیعی',array['talent']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give somebody a gift We gave her a gift on her birthday.','receive a gift He received a gift from his aunt.','accept a gift Sam accepted the gift on behalf of the school.','make somebody a gift of something formal (= give someone something as a gift ) Johnson made her a gift of a book.','wrap (up) a gift She had bought and wrapped gifts for children in hospital.','shower somebody with gifts (= give someone a lot of gifts ) He showered her with gifts and exotic holidays.','exchange gifts (= give someone a gift at the same time as they give you a gift ) We exchange gifts on Christmas Day.','a birthday gift The camera had been a 21st birthday gift from his parents.','a wedding gift Some people prefer to give cash as a wedding gift.','a Christmas gift Before 1940, most people did not wrap Christmas gifts.','a free gift (= something that a shop or business gives you ) If you spend over £50, you get a free gift.','the perfect/ideal gift for somebody This book is the perfect gift for anybody who’s interested in birds.','a suitable gift What do you think would be a suitable gift for a 10-year-old boy?','a small gift Here’s a small gift to show our appreciation for all your hard work.','a generous gift Her colleagues presented her with a generous gift when she retired.','an expensive gift He was always showering Louise with expensive gifts.','a lavish gift (= a large, impressive, or expensive gift ) She received lavish gifts of jewellery and clothes.','a parting gift (= a gift that you give someone when you leave/say goodbye ) She brought him a parting gift.','an unwanted gift You can take any unwanted gifts to charity shops.','a gift idea Here is another gift idea with children in mind.','a gift shop The gift shop was well stocked with souvenirs.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a gift for languages","translation":"هدیه ای برای زبان ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718262.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was a kind man, with a gift for forming lasting friendships.","translation":"او مردی مهربان بود، با استعدادی برای ایجاد دوستی های پایدار.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001296075.mp3"},{"sentence":"She has the rare gift of being able to laugh at herself.","translation":"او این موهبت نادر را دارد که بتواند به خودش بخندد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718265.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was said to have possessed the gift of prophecy.","translation":"گفته می شد که او دارای موهبت نبوت بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718274.mp3"},{"sentence":"the use of spiritual gifts","translation":"استفاده از مواهب معنوی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718275.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
