('42a69bcf-88c2-5523-ae88-f69dff95828f','2a2e0f14-777e-510c-8858-fd8e07b89e6b',4,'hair/nails','مو / ناخن','spoken & written','if you grow your hair or nails , you do not cut them','[ transitive ]',null,'اگر مو یا ناخن خود را رشد دهید، آنها را کوتاه نمی کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve decided to grow my hair long .","translation":"من تصمیم گرفتم موهایم را بلند کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001702221.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7faf6d80-ef29-513e-ace4-17b94d7a3307','2a2e0f14-777e-510c-8858-fd8e07b89e6b',5,'become','تبدیل شود','spoken & written','to change and become different quite slowly','[ intransitive always + adj ]',null,'تغییر کند و به آرامی متفاوت شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The sound was growing louder.","translation":"صدا داشت بلندتر می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001702234.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her tastes have changed as she’s grown older.","translation":"سلیقه او با بزرگتر شدن تغییر کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001702235.mp3"},{"sentence":"Donna has grown tired of being a model.","translation":"دونا از مدل بودن خسته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781288.mp3"},{"sentence":"Gradually, Fiona’s eyes grew used to the darkness (= she gradually became able to see a little better ) .","translation":"به تدریج، چشمان فیونا به تاریکی عادت کرد (= او به تدریج توانست کمی بهتر ببیند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001702236.mp3"},{"sentence":"After a while the kids grew to like Mr Cox.","translation":"بعد از مدتی بچه ها از آقای کاکس خوششان آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001702242.mp3"},{"sentence":"the city he had grown to love","translation":"شهری که عاشقش شده بود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001702243.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sound was getting louder.","translation":"صدا داشت بلندتر می شد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,7),
('54033c8f-340f-5388-beb4-fd2e3d0174b8','2a2e0f14-777e-510c-8858-fd8e07b89e6b',6,'improve','بهبود بخشد','spoken & written','to gradually become better, bigger etc','[ intransitive ]',null,'به تدریج بهتر، بزرگتر و غیره شدن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s grown tremendously as a musician.","translation":"او به عنوان یک نوازنده به شدت رشد کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001306177.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e2872fd7-7534-5462-87e2-233dfe2bbc93','2a2e0f14-777e-510c-8858-fd8e07b89e6b',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'it/money doesn’t grow on trees','رشد کردن، بزرگ شدن؛ کشت کردن (مو)؛ پرورش دادن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('25fadce9-974a-5e7c-8628-2a73150b2c35','d0d8cc77-5d04-52c4-93b3-7bb721f9b3a6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the mass of things like fine threads that grows on your head','[ uncountable ]',null,'مو، پرز؛ مو (بافت)؛ بر (سوختگی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['dark He’s about six feet tall, with dark hair and blue eyes.','black his long black hair','jet black literary (= completely black ) She had shiny jet black hair, and skin as white as snow.','fair Her long fair hair fell untidily over her shoulders.','blond/blonde (= yellowish-white in colour ) long blonde hair and blue eyes','golden the beautiful girl with the long golden hair','brown Her hair was pale brown.','chestnut literary (= dark brown ) She had a fine head of chestnut hair.','sandy (= yellowish-brown ) He wore his long, sandy brown hair in a ponytail.','mousy (= an unattractive dull brown ) I have pale, mousy hair that is dull and lacks shine.','red The whole family had red hair.','ginger British English (= orange-brown in colour ) a cheeky little boy with ginger hair','auburn literary (= orange-brown in colour ) He gazed at her long neck and beautiful auburn hair.','white an old man with white hair','grey British English , gray American English She was about 70, with grey hair.','silver Her father’s hair was starting to turn silver.','short I like your hair when it’s short like that.','long A few of the boys had long hair.','shoulder-length/medium-length He had shoulder-length reddish hair.','straight a girl with long straight hair','curly When he was young, his hair was thick and curly.','frizzy (= tightly curled ) She had dark frizzy hair which might have been permed.','wavy (= with loose curls ) Her golden wavy hair fell around her shoulders.','thick She had thick hair down to her waist.','fine (= thin ) Her hair is so fine, it’s difficult to style.','spiky (= stiff and standing up on top of your head ) Billy had black spiky hair.','in good/bad/terrible etc condition How do you keep your hair in such perfect condition?','out of condition (= no longer in good condition ) If your hair is out of condition, this may be because you are eating the wrong foods.','glossy/shiny She combed her hair until it was all glossy.','lustrous literary (= very shiny and attractive ) her lustrous dark hair flowing on to her shoulders','dull (= not shiny ) a shampoo for dull hair','greasy (= containing too much oil ) This shampoo is ideal for greasy hair.','dry (= lacking oil ) a shampoo for dry hair','lank especially literary (= thin, straight, and unattractive ) a scruffy young man with lank hair','thinning (= becoming thinner because you are losing your hair ) His dark hair was thinning on top.','receding (= gradually disappearing, so that it is high on your forehead ) The man was in his late thirties, and his hair was receding slightly.','dishevelled especially literary (= very untidy ) His face was bright red and his hair looked dishevelled.','tousled especially literary (= a little untidy, in a way that looks attractive ) his youthfully handsome face and tousled hair that hung untidily over his collar','windswept especially literary (= blown around by the wind ) Her hair was all windswept when they came off the beach.','have ... hair She has beautiful blonde hair.','brush/comb your hair He cleaned his teeth and brushed his hair.','wash your hair He showered and washed his hair.','do your hair ( also fix your hair American English ) (= arrange it in a style ) She’s upstairs doing her hair.','have your hair cut/done/permed ( also get your hair cut etc ) (= by a hairdresser ) I need to get my hair cut.','cut somebody’s hair My mum always cuts my hair.','dye your hair (blonde/red etc) (= change its colour, especially using chemicals ) Craig has dyed his hair black.','wear your hair long/in a ponytail etc (= have that style of hair ) He wore his hair in a ponytail.','grow your hair (long) (= let it grow longer ) I’m growing my hair long, but it’s taking forever.','lose your hair (= become bald ) He was a small, round man who was losing his hair.','run your fingers through somebody’s hair (= touch someone’s hair in a loving way ) He ran his fingers through her smooth silky hair.','ruffle somebody’s hair (= rub it in a kind friendly way ) He patted me on the back and ruffled my hair.','hair loss The drug can cause hair loss.','hair colour British English , hair color American English Genes control characteristics such as hair colour and eye colour.','hair dye The survey showed that 75% of women have used hair dye.','a strand/wisp of hair (= a thin piece of hair ) She brushed away a strand of hair from her eyes.','a lock of hair (= a fairly thick piece of hair ) She tossed a stray lock of hair back off her forehead.','a mop of hair (= a large amount of thick untidy hair ) He had an unruly mop of brown hair.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her hair was short and dark.","translation":"موهایش کوتاه و تیره بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000740.mp3"},{"sentence":"a short fat man with no hair on his head","translation":"مردی چاق کوتاه قد بدون موی سرش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000741.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s a tall fair-haired guy.","translation":"او یک پسر بلند قد مو روشن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967616.mp3"},{"sentence":"He has black hair.","translation":"او موهای مشکی دارد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
