('be10f273-2f64-5bc6-8b5a-a4ae9fc6f751','7465d98d-e25f-52d5-8ce1-60bae0f9210e',1,'top part fastened','قسمت بالایی بسته شده','spoken & written','to put something in a position so that the top part is fixed or supported , and the bottom part is free to move and does not touch the ground','[ transitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'آویختن، چسباندن (بالا)؛ معلق کردن (چراغ)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Philip hung his coat on a hook behind the door.","translation":"فیلیپ کتش را به قلاب پشت در آویزان کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001341358.mp3"},{"sentence":"She hung the sheets on the washing line.","translation":"ملحفه را روی خط شستشو آویزان کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001720437.mp3"},{"sentence":"An old-fashioned gas lamp hung from the ceiling.","translation":"یک چراغ گازی قدیمی از سقف آویزان بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001341365.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her long hair hung loose about her shoulders.","translation":"موهای بلندش روی شانه هایش آویزان بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001720438.mp3"},{"sentence":"The shirt hung down almost to his ankles.","translation":"پیراهن تقریباً تا مچ پایش آویزان بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001720439.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
