('d28335c7-5c11-567f-ad22-26cffd88d9a8','3c630f60-1571-50e9-9e60-62a33a7d66e2',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an angry unpleasant feeling that someone has when they hate someone and want to harm them',null,null,'یک احساس ناخوشایند خشمگینی که وقتی کسی از کسی متنفر است و می‌خواهد به او آسیب برساند دارد',array['hatred']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be full of hate/be filled with hate People’s faces were full of hate.','a look of hate He gave me a look of pure hate as I entered the room.','a message of hate White nationalists are using the media to preach a message of hate.','somebody’s eyes are burning/smouldering/blazing with hate literary Then he noticed the dark eyes, smouldering with hate.','absolute/pure hate (= complete and total hate ) His speech was an expression of pure hate.','a hate figure (= someone who is hated by a lot of people ) After the incident, he became a hate figure in the British press.','hate mail (= letters or messages expressing hate and threats towards someone ) Since appearing on the show she has even received hate mail from the public.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her eyes were full of hate.","translation":"چشمانش پر از نفرت بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001712173.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mrs Williams has spoken of her hate for her husband’s killers.","translation":"خانم ویلیامز از نفرت خود از قاتلان شوهرش صحبت کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001712176.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('56e5b8cd-cbb8-57ad-a616-e8da3de81e3e','b2c0ba81-9c35-5dcf-b5ed-ac9883d47533',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used with past participles to form perfect tenses',null,null,'با فعل ماضی برای تشکیل زمان های کامل استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Our guests have arrived.","translation":"مهمانان ما آمده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001347457.mp3"},{"sentence":"Has anyone phoned?","translation":"کسی تلفن زده؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001347458.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ve been spending too much money.","translation":"ما خیلی پول خرج کردیم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001347459.mp3"},{"sentence":"I hadn’t seen him for 15 years.","translation":"15 سال بود که او را ندیده بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020080.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘I hope you’ve read the instructions.’ ‘Yes, of course I have.’","translation":"«امیدوارم دستورالعمل‌ها را خوانده باشید.» «بله، البته که خوانده‌ام.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786744.mp3"},{"sentence":"You haven’t done much, have you?","translation":"شما کار زیادی انجام نداده اید، نه؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786745.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
