('9dc3cfc9-2798-5d66-9175-54dfbb92e3de','8abf2a41-2dca-5849-97ea-091b570941e5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','things you do to make it easier or possible for someone to do something','[ uncountable ]',null,'کارهایی که انجام می دهید تا انجام کاری را برای کسی آسانتر یا ممکن کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give somebody help Do you want me to give you some help?','ask (somebody) for help He asked for help with the cleaning.','need help Some of the older patients need help with walking.','get/receive help She gets no help from her husband.','offer (your) help The taxi driver offered his help and we accepted.','provide help The government should do more to provide help for people who are looking for work.','appeal for help (= publicly ask for help ) The police are appealing for help to track down the killer.','enlist somebody’s help (= persuade someone to help you ) She enlisted the help of a private investigator to find her missing son.','find help To get it finished by tomorrow, we’ll need to find help from somewhere.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Thank you for all your help.","translation":"از همه کمک شما متشکرم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001725314.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you want any help with the washing up?","translation":"آیا برای شستشو کمک می خواهید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001356193.mp3"},{"sentence":"I could do with some help to bring the bags in from the car.","translation":"می توانستم با کمک کمی کیف ها را از ماشین بیاورم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000765.mp3"},{"sentence":"He asked for my help in getting an interview with her.","translation":"برای مصاحبه با او از من کمک خواست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000766.mp3"},{"sentence":"We manage, with the help of a nurse who comes daily.","translation":"ما با کمک پرستاری که هر روز می آید مدیریت می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001725321.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('09150685-bed9-589e-9cb4-cd2a129ff946','8abf2a41-2dca-5849-97ea-091b570941e5',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if someone or something is a help to you, they are useful and make it easier for you to do something','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'اگر کسی یا چیزی به شما کمک می کند، مفید است و انجام کاری را برای شما آسان می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"That map isn’t much help.","translation":"این نقشه کمک زیادی نمی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001356198.mp3"},{"sentence":"I managed to make myself understood with the help of a phrase book.","translation":"با کمک یک کتاب عبارات توانستم خودم را درک کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001725331.mp3"},{"sentence":"Let me know if I can be of any help to you.","translation":"اگر می توانم کمکی به شما کنم به من اطلاع دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001356204.mp3"},{"sentence":"Any information would be a great help.","translation":"هر گونه اطلاعات کمک بزرگی خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001725334.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’ve been a real help to me, Carrie.","translation":"تو کمک واقعی من بودی کری.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001725335.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('9b7ce169-0f75-5ff8-a82c-69a8e26857c4','8abf2a41-2dca-5849-97ea-091b570941e5',3,null,null,'spoken & written','advice , treatment , information, or money which is given to people who need it','[ uncountable ]',null,'مشاوره، درمان، اطلاعات یا پولی که به افرادی که به آن نیاز دارند داده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A lot of these children need professional help.","translation":"بسیاری از این کودکان نیاز به کمک حرفه ای دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001356228.mp3"},{"sentence":"You may be able to ask for help with the rent.","translation":"ممکن است بتوانید برای اجاره کمک بخواهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001356231.mp3"},{"sentence":"We received no help from the police.","translation":"هیچ کمکی از پلیس دریافت نکردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001807290.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('0c4863e5-2e96-5b86-9664-d2f8e796cc4c','8abf2a41-2dca-5849-97ea-091b570941e5',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a part of a computer program that helps someone using it by giving additional information','[ uncountable ]',null,'بخشی از یک برنامه کامپیوتری که با دادن اطلاعات اضافی به شخصی در استفاده از آن کمک می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
