('26dca143-632f-5236-a646-c51701f2e548','8e2c87a2-a113-5879-9951-c90696f30e47',1,'place where you live','مکانی که در آن زندگی می کنید','spoken & written','the house, apartment , or place where you live','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'خانه، مسکن؛ خانه (خانواده)؛ مقر (سازمان)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a secure/stable home (= a caring family without a lot of changes ) He had grown up in a stable home.','a happy home (= a happy family ) We had a happy home.','a broken home (= a family in which the parents have separated ) Many of the youngsters came from broken homes.','the family home (= where a family lives ) The house was once the family home of the O''Dare family.','the marital home (= where a husband and wife live ) He left the marital home to move in with his lover.','somebody’s childhood/boyhood etc home (= where you lived as a child ) I had not been back to my childhood home for ten years.','a permanent/temporary home Flood victims were offered temporary homes.','live at home (= live with your parents ) More people in their twenties are still living at home because housing is so expensive.','leave home (= stop living with your parents at home ) Lisa had left home at age 16.','work from/at home (= do your work at home instead of at an office ) I work at home three days a week.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"They have a beautiful home in California.","translation":"آنها خانه زیبایی در کالیفرنیا دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001356834.mp3"},{"sentence":"Good luck in your new home!","translation":"در خانه جدید خود موفق باشید!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967046.mp3"},{"sentence":"Last night we stayed at home and watched TV.","translation":"دیشب در خانه ماندیم و تلویزیون تماشا کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001738993.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was spending more and more time away from home.","translation":"او بیشتر و بیشتر وقت خود را دور از خانه می گذراند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967049.mp3"},{"sentence":"A family of birds made their home (= started living ) under the roof.","translation":"خانواده ای از پرندگان زیر سقف خانه (= شروع به زندگی کردند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739001.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('a6aea044-ae86-563d-8768-47ced328ce08','8e2c87a2-a113-5879-9951-c90696f30e47',2,'family','خانواده','spoken & written','the place where a child lived with his or her family','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'جایی که کودک با خانواده اش زندگی می کرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a secure/stable home (= a caring family without a lot of changes ) He had grown up in a stable home.','a happy home (= a happy family ) We had a happy home.','a broken home (= a family in which the parents have separated ) Many of the youngsters came from broken homes.','the family home (= where a family lives ) The house was once the family home of the O''Dare family.','the marital home (= where a husband and wife live ) He left the marital home to move in with his lover.','somebody’s childhood/boyhood etc home (= where you lived as a child ) I had not been back to my childhood home for ten years.','a permanent/temporary home Flood victims were offered temporary homes.','live at home (= live with your parents ) More people in their twenties are still living at home because housing is so expensive.','leave home (= stop living with your parents at home ) Lisa had left home at age 16.','work from/at home (= do your work at home instead of at an office ) I work at home three days a week.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Jack left home when he was 16.","translation":"جک در 16 سالگی خانه را ترک کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739005.mp3"},{"sentence":"Were you still living at home (= with your parents ) ?","translation":"آیا هنوز در خانه (= با پدر و مادرتان) زندگی می کردید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739009.mp3"},{"sentence":"Carrie moved out of the family home a year ago.","translation":"کری یک سال پیش از خانه خانواده نقل مکان کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967054.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
