ernment proposed changes to the jury system.','jury service (= when you have to spend time on a jury ) He has been called for jury service in July.','a jury trial (= a trial with a jury ) Should all accused people have a jury trial?']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7c4b7ce8-4ff9-5b1e-96f1-9f6cbdd12e71','21520d1a-336c-53e8-880c-135654aa71ef',1,null,null,'spoken & written','exactly',null,null,'فقط، همین الان؛ دقیقاً؛ عادلانه (حکم)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A good strong cup of coffee is just what I need right now.","translation":"یک فنجان قهوه قوی و خوب همان چیزی است که در حال حاضر به آن نیاز دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432758.mp3"},{"sentence":"The house was large and roomy; just right for us.","translation":"خانه بزرگ و جادار بود. فقط برای ما مناسب است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432759.mp3"},{"sentence":"She looks just like her mother.","translation":"او دقیقا شبیه مادرش است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432760.mp3"},{"sentence":"Just what do you think you’re trying to do?","translation":"فقط فکر میکنی میخوای چیکار کنی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000879.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s just on three o’clock.","translation":"همین الان ساعت سه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788240.mp3"},{"sentence":"Just then (= exactly at that moment ) , Mrs Robovitch appeared at the bedroom door.","translation":"درست در همان لحظه (= دقیقاً در آن لحظه)، خانم روبوویچ در اتاق خواب ظاهر شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000880.mp3"},{"sentence":"Just as (= at the exact moment when ) I opened the door, the telephone started to ring.","translation":"درست زمانی که (= دقیقاً در لحظه ای که ) در را باز کردم، تلفن شروع به زنگ زدن کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000881.mp3"},{"sentence":"A nice hot bath – just the thing (= exactly the right thing ) to relax sore muscles.","translation":"یک حمام آب گرم خوب - فقط چیزی که (= دقیقاً چیزی است) برای شل کردن عضلات دردناک.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000882.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('51e360ba-9d46-5471-a33d-a92d02218ce5','21520d1a-336c-53e8-880c-135654aa71ef',2,null,null,'spoken & written','nothing more than the thing, amount, action etc that you are mentioning',null,null,'چیزی بیشتر از چیزی، مقدار، عمل و غیره که شما ذکر می کنید',array['only']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s nothing serious – just a small cut.","translation":"این چیز جدی نیست - فقط یک برش کوچک.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432764.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t be too hard on him – he’s just a kid.","translation":"خیلی به او سخت نگیرید - او فقط یک بچه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788255.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you wait just a few minutes?","translation":"می توانید فقط چند دقیقه صبر کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432765.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s not just me – there are other people involved as well.","translation":"این فقط من نیستم - افراد دیگری نیز درگیر هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788256.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s simply a question of priorities.","translation":"این فقط یک سوال از اولویت ها است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('83436ff1-8f01-5456-bf99-ea5b52dfc4f1','21520d1a-336c-53e8-880c-135654aa71ef',3,null,null,'spoken & written','only a short time ago',null,null,'همین چند وقت پیش','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"John’s just told me that he’s getting married.","translation":"جان فقط به من گفت که ازدواج می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432769.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve just been out shopping.","translation":"من تازه بیرون رفته بودم خرید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432770.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ad7bc23d-a6f8-5638-b31d-5e047cfc9fb8','21520d1a-336c-53e8-880c-135654aa71ef',4,null,null,'spoken & written','at this moment or at that moment',null,null,'در این لحظه یا در آن لحظه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Wait a minute – I’m just coming.","translation":"یک لحظه صبر کنید - من تازه می آیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788257.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was just leaving when the phone rang.","translation":"تازه داشت می رفت که تلفن زنگ خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432774.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m just finishing my homework – it won’t take long.","translation":"من فقط دارم تکالیفم را تمام می کنم - زیاد طول نمی کشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788258.mp3"},{"sentence":"The concert was just about to start.","translation":"کنسرت تازه شروع شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432775.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('28b28d6b-9d4d-5cae-98fc-6a75b4118210','21520d1a-336c-53e8-880c-135654aa71ef',5,null,null,'spoken & written','used to emphasize what you are saying',null,null,'برای تأکید بر آنچه می گویید استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It just isn’t true.","translation":"فقط درست نیست","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432779.mp3"},{"sentence":"I just love being in the mountains.","translation":"من فقط دوست دارم در کوه باشم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432780.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was just wonderful to see Joyce again.","translation":"دیدن دوباره جویس فوق العاده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000883.mp3"},{"sentence":"I just wish I could believe you.","translation":"فقط کاش میتونستم باورت کنم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788260.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('ef2db57c-0d02-5c91-a2d7-285d2e1a6367','21520d1a-336c-53e8-880c-135654aa71ef',6,null,null,'spoken & written','only by a small amount, time, distance etc',null,null,'فقط با مقدار کمی، زمان، فاصله و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We moved here just after our son was born.","translation":"درست بعد از تولد پسرمان به اینجا نقل مکان کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788264.mp3"},{"sentence":"I saw her just before she died.","translation":"درست قبل از مرگ او را دیدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432786.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s just under three centimetres long.","translation":"فقط کمتر از سه سانتی متر طول دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432787.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5d8d4408-995a-5f21-9d06-d2b980ad4350','21520d1a-336c-53e8-880c-135654aa71ef',7,null,null,'spoken & written','used to show that something which happens almost does not happen',null,null,'برای نشان دادن اینکه چیزی که اتفاق می افتد تقریباً اتفاق نمی افتد استفاده می شود',array['barely','hardly']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He just managed to get home before dark.","translation":"او فقط قبل از تاریک شدن هوا توانست به خانه برسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001432792.mp3"},{"sentence":"We could just see the coast of France in the distance.","translation":"ما فقط می توانستیم سواحل فرانسه را در دوردست ببینیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788265.mp3"},{"sentence":"Those pants only just fit you now.","translation":"اون شلوارها الان فقط بهت میاد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788266.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was earning just enough money to live on (= enough but not more than enough ) .","translation":"او فقط به اندازه کافی پول برای زندگی به دست می آورد (= به اندازه کافی اما نه بیشتر از کافی).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001788270.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
