('aed8e973-7a70-513c-b218-8a2d79527237','eb37ef01-8c6e-5a3f-ab37-e54062915766',3,null,null,'spoken & written','an animal that is killed by another animal','[ singular ]',null,'حیوانی که توسط حیوان دیگری کشته می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The cubs will share the remains of the kill.","translation":"توله ها بقایای کشتار را به اشتراک خواهند گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001729450.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('dccbc4e4-5eab-5bc2-bcd9-771b62589dc1','b62fc89c-999d-58a7-b0fe-937b1542f635',1,null,null,'spoken & written','one of the different types of a person or thing that belong to the same group','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'نوع، گونه؛ همان نوع (چیز)',array['sort, type']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['all kinds/every kind He’s done all kinds of work.','the same kind I’d like to see you make the same kind of effort in practice that you make in the game.','a different kind Fossils of many different kinds have been found in this site.','the right/wrong kind It wasn’t the right kind of holiday for me.','the best/worst kind Not knowing what had happened to her was the worst kind of torture.','some kind Carved into the stone was some kind of design.','any kind There was no television, no radio – no technology of any kind.','various kinds The students had to read various kinds of academic materials.','a certain/particular kind A ‘besom’ is a particular kind of broom.','of its/their kind It is the biggest centre of its kind.','of this kind How can we be sure a disaster of this kind will not happen again?','of the worst/best etc kind This is hypocrisy of the worst kind.','what kind (of something)? What kind of milk shake would you like?','that kind of thing He usually wears trainers and jeans, that kind of thing.','in a funny/strange etc kind of way In a funny kind of way, the bullying made me a stronger person.','precisely/exactly the kind This was precisely the kind of help that she needed.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"They sell all kinds of things.","translation":"همه جور چیزایی رو میفروشن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001729488.mp3"},{"sentence":"The flowers attract several different kinds of insects.","translation":"گل ها انواع مختلفی از حشرات را جذب می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001729492.mp3"},{"sentence":"Greg was working on some kind of deal in Italy.","translation":"گرگ مشغول کار بر روی نوعی معامله در ایتالیا بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973870.mp3"},{"sentence":"Get me a sandwich – any kind will do.","translation":"یک ساندویچ برای من بیاور - هر نوعی که باشد انجام خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973874.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('82d5bd97-41a0-5cdd-ad89-ee6b6a878678','b62fc89c-999d-58a7-b0fe-937b1542f635',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the kind','نوع، گونه؛ همان نوع (چیز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['all kinds/every kind He’s done all kinds of work.','the same kind I’d like to see you make the same kind of effort in practice that you make in the game.','a different kind Fossils of many different kinds have been found in this site.','the right/wrong kind It wasn’t the right kind of holiday for me.','the best/worst kind Not knowing what had happened to her was the worst kind of torture.','some kind Carved into the stone was some kind of design.','any kind There was no television, no radio – no technology of any kind.','various kinds The students had to read various kinds of academic materials.','a certain/particular kind A ‘besom’ is a particular kind of broom.','of its/their kind It is the biggest centre of its kind.','of this kind How can we be sure a disaster of this kind will not happen again?','of the worst/best etc kind This is hypocrisy of the worst kind.','what kind (of something)? What kind of milk shake would you like?','that kind of thing He usually wears trainers and jeans, that kind of thing.','in a funny/strange etc kind of way In a funny kind of way, the bullying made me a stronger person.','precisely/exactly the kind This was precisely the kind of help that she needed.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
